  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Spell. Create a Maelstrom at target foe's location. For 10 seconds, foes adjacent to that area are struck for 10...22...25 cold damage each second. Maelstrom interrupts spell-casting when it hits.",
      "zhTW": "在目標敵人所在地點創造水漩渦。持續 10 秒，使鄰近水漩渦的敵人每秒受到 10～25 冰凍傷害。水漩渦命中目標時會中斷其施法動作。此魔法會造成施法者精疲力竭。"
    },
    "pvp": null
  },
